    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e3",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_2",
      "quote": "Four previous reviews have assessed the quality of COVID-19 CPGs [16-18]... However, an assessment of all the CPGs focused on the management of critically ill COVID -19 patients was lacking. We, therefore, aimed to systematically identify the CPGs for the management of critically ill patients with COVID-19, and critically assess their quality for both clinical and methodological purposes.",
      "reason": "The manuscript describes existing similar reviews and then explains the gap (no assessment of all critically ill COVID-19 management CPGs), motivating the current review."
    },
    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_3_e4",
      "status": "NOT_APPLICABLE",
      "chunk_id": null,
      "quote": null,
      "reason": "The provided evidence does not show that this review proposes and evaluates an intervention effect with a described mechanism of action; it focuses on identifying and critically assessing clinical practice guidelines."
    },
